cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research, please cite the repository and technical write-up."
title: "I-OWN-URING: Syscall-less Shellcode via Linux io_uring"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vitali
    given-names: Maycon
    alias: maycon
repository-code: "https://github.com/maycon/I-OWN-URING"
url: "https://github.com/maycon/I-OWN-URING"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An x86_64 research toolkit demonstrating that Linux monitoring attached only
  to sys_enter cannot observe individual file and network operations submitted
  through io_uring. It includes raw-syscall PoCs, shellcode, a YAML mission
  builder, defensive analysis, and a reproducible Falco evaluation.
keywords:
  - io_uring
  - Linux
  - shellcode
  - EDR
  - eBPF
  - security research
